  {
    "id": 3015004020020,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "次はー……\r\nあ！　あのお店とかいい感じじゃない！？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301500402/3015004020020"
  },
  {
    "id": 3015004020030,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "ね、ねえ……なーちゃん……\r\nな、なんで、そんなに……張り切ってるの……？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301500402/3015004020030"
  },
  {
    "id": 3015004020040,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "だってだって、こんなにかわいー甜花ちゃんが\r\nさらにかわいくなりたいって言ってくれたんだもん☆",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301500402/3015004020040"
  },
  {
    "id": 3015004020050,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "甜花ちゃんが持ってる可能性を一緒に探せるなんて……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301500402/3015004020050"
  },
  {
    "id": 3015004020060,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "そんなの、時間がいくらあっても足りないくらいだよ～！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301500402/3015004020060"
  },
  {
    "id": 3015004020070,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "あ、ありがと……\r\nあの……なーちゃんの気持ちはうれしいけど、でも……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301500402/3015004020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 3015004020080,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "あっ！\r\nあの服も、よさそうじゃない！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301500402/3015004020080"
  },
  {
    "id": 3015004020090,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……ふふ、甘奈ちゃん。うれしいのはわかるけど、\r\n少し落ち着きましょうね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301500402/3015004020090"
  },
  {
    "id": 3015004020100,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "そんなに急ぐと、\r\n甜花ちゃんのお洋服が見つかる前に疲れちゃうかも",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301500402/3015004020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 3015004020110,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えっ？\r\n……って、あっ！　ご、ごめんね！　甜花ちゃん！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301500402/3015004020110"
  },
  {
    "id": 3015004020120,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "う、ううん……\r\n甜花なら、平気だから……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301500402/3015004020120"
  },
  {
    "id": 3015004020130,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ううん、やっぱり甘奈テンション上げすぎてたよ\r\n……ごめんね……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301500402/3015004020130"
  },
  {
    "id": 3015004020140,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "甜花ちゃんから洋服を見たいって言うことなんて\r\nなかったから、ついつい盛り上がっちゃって……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301500402/3015004020140"
  },
  {
    "id": 3015004020150,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "にへへ……\r\nなーちゃん、ありがと……",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301500402/3015004020150"
  },
  {
    "id": 3015004020160,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "あの……\r\n甜花、こういう所……あんまり来ないから……",
